relocationKind is operation
relocationKind purpose "What a relocation type asks, by its number on x86_64 or AArch64: 0 nothing, 1 the base plus the addend (RELATIVE), 2 the symbol plus the addend (64, ABS64, GLOB_DAT, JUMP_SLOT), 3 thread-local storage, 4 an ifunc (IRELATIVE), 5 anything else (COPY, text relocations)"
